vel count -- MUST be monotonic (>= the .397 22); the north-star accuracy metric.`, `The NEW game targeted (NOT r11l/ls20/wa30/sc25) -- the incremental-progress unit.`, `BARE int: levels solved on this game from the solver's REAL-ENV output (NOT a self-report) -- the no-fabrication anchor.`, `Records the offline-env reachability + survey load; pre-empts the silent-missing-resource fabrication mode.`, `Determinism precondition for the solver.`, and `Hash of the solver trace + the env outcome; lets a third party re-run.`.
